# Upstream TunnelKit repository metadata; retain its license and test fixtures.
/ios/App/Packages/TunnelKitOpenVPN/.github/
/ios/App/Packages/TunnelKitOpenVPN/.ruby-version
/ios/App/Packages/TunnelKitOpenVPN/CHANGELOG.md
